            <ArticleTitle>Opioids for osteoarthritis? Weighing benefits and risks: a Cochrane Musculoskeletal Group review.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>206-12</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Untreated pain is a major public health problem, but concerns about opioid misuse remain. This evidence-based look at when--or whether--opioids are indicated for OA patients will help you achieve the right balance.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
